[00:39.98] Briɣ i usawan
[00:42.70] Iṭij iḍall-d i tɣaltin
[00:52.88] At Ɛisi mbaɛid la ttbanen
[00:56.81] Yuweḍ-iten leḥzen
[00:59.27] Deg iɛeḍran ma ṛẓan-t lesnin
[01:08.67] Ɣef yiɣsan n widak xenqen
[01:14.41] Di tmura ibeɛden
[01:20.14] Iḍher i yeḥzen wedrar meskin
[01:26.12]
[01:40.10] Ɣef yifran ḍallent wallen
[01:44.37] Ikbel-aɣ leḥzen
[01:47.23] Tafat tejbed iman-is
[01:57.73] Ma d adrar i ɣ-iḥurben
[02:01.29] Yucaf seg yidammen
[02:04.21] Seg urebbi-s i ddmen mmi-s
[02:14.12] Iḍes yekseb imdanen
[02:20.16] Seg iles iten-qqsen
[02:25.94] Ktalen i wegdud
[02:27.93] Tardast taselqist
[02:31.85]
[02:45.95] Ṭṭlam iɛjel-d tikli-s
[02:50.06] Iḥar s amekkan-is
[02:52.86] S leḥzen i iɣumm tafat
[03:02.85] Tedher-iyi temṭṭut s mmi-s
[03:06.72] Tzemmeḍ afus-is
[03:09.78] Fell-asen lehwa tekkat
[03:19.70] Tesla uwin argaz-is
[03:25.63] Ur teḥkim iẓṛi-s
[03:31.23] Wiss ma d as-t-id-terr s axxam teswaɛt
[03:37.46]
[03:51.30] Acḥal n widak nuwi
[03:55.44] Ar ass-a ur d-zzin
[03:58.09] Wiss tasraft deg i ten-rran
[04:08.69] D ilmeẓyen d tilmeẓyin
[04:12.28] Deg waluḍ ɣlin
[04:15.21] Rran-ten d ayen ur llan
[04:25.63] I widak di zzman yukin
[04:30.55] Ɣebban-ten lesnin
[04:36.71] Ger ṛebɛa n leḥyud ass-a i d-gran
